        RX04: Clinical decision support protocols.

        Args:
            case_id: Clinical case ID
            check_type: Check type (e.g., "vital_signs", "lab_results")
            from_state: Source state
            to_state: Target state
            tenant_id: KPI-029: Tenant ID

        Returns:
            True nếu check pass, False nếu fail
        """
        # TODO: Implement clinical decision logic
